OL,3,GNEWSAHow karaoke clip of late son
OL,4,Abrought back parents' smiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man who died following
OL,7,Fan epileptic fit is smiling again.
OL,9,FIt's a video of her late son that's
OL,10,Fbeen amusing her, although it's one
OL,11,Fthat still makes her cry.
OL,13,FThe reson for Donna Smith's mirth is
OL,14,Fthat son Liam is doing karaoke on the
OL,15,Fclip. There's just one problem - he
OL,16,Fcan't sing. And, she says, the footage
OL,17,Fis gettting "funnier and funnier".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
