OL,3,GNEWSAHow karaoke clip of late son
OL,4,Abrought back parents' smiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's his love of music regardless that
OL,7,Fshe has found so comforting, with plans
OL,8,Ffor a music festival in his memory - to
OL,9,Fraise awareness of epilepsy - described
OL,10,Fby the family as amazing.
